    <title>Vol.29 我，可能是个生活的天才</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ad34f770e4e410a05be44c5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ad34f770e4e410a05be44c5</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>一些零零碎碎的来自深更半夜的碎碎念。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>为什么我总是这么开心呢？</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>答案没准就是我可能是个生活的天才吧哈哈哈。</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="98">00:01:38</a> 小流浪们</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkL4wWglMQcU8wiAuyIWzQuMILz8.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">00:12:30</a> 减少损耗的方法，不是逃走，而是转移注意力</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgRxp4A1tzcQYyYNzlFFktjuOmRL.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsOU_paMt1P-DD79WCS_4pWwz6Fg.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhXrxGIjOC9coq2UmjBJMDTN-FKO.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frbmu51Z42344OVJyeEVXw_p2Qcc.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqLk7r5e7Fmx3GXV5VRRsDAhI18u.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhWNmNiQIQvL0qiginbsoeES9oSj.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlUO7HWHQpMYaHVBoIfpEG-0ftZs.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft-tS4VwTB8xllnBGyG9KJEZWo_h.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lqUYfR_SwCkIPD5cMLo_BxuxnWTL.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmoy1CI6KZYsZc3foXkEEKuz9bqb.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvPDs4jNLllcd3xNNbkvzNbaoipr.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1259">00:20:59</a> 我的台历设计旅程</span></p><p><span>第一年👇</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FonCs7dt94WH77XyUXyhVPa7NbPM.jpg"><p><span>第二年👇</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsqWuufVf9McARWZmUIF7yTAul7j.jpg"><p><span>第三年👇</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjLPdKOiBysl8MM3gNaiLeSSkm6k.jpg"><p><span>第四年👇</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgWMPjZv3Ldv6RK68LkjRaKd3f3k.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgqv8YE7b3zzJyAYPclTYmGlpTW_.jpg"><p><span>第五年👇</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl72t0XEo3zi7-RRRqtZwaJOoDD_.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fks85b2RBdk7b_yQUSt_-K62vquk.jpg"><p><span>第六年👇</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiE0ZD-rE0ynsFfVFIN73YxPRyZ_.jpg"><p><span>第七年（先保密一下嘿嘿）👇</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlpxDry7_i2Wk4FiCjV8adoH5zY2.png"><p><span>   <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2013">00:33:33</a> 最近的心流小时刻</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlKUR0Ianr6fcPWvViV6La23T6bF.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmhrX9VUU6s9VHR2U-d9tRSCPNvm.jpg"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2140">00:35:40</a> 闪光好物市集和宠爱流浪动物领养（欢迎大家来玩～～～！）</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqh-mFp7fsrQ9RRvaOX2QEaYyHNa.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlaaHTOMKcbhD3Gf-z1-MVbWbtnq.jpg"><p><span>🕙</span></p><p><strong><span>干杯吧朋友们！</span></strong></p><p><span>谢谢收听，欢迎留言或者分享，爱大家</span></p><p><span>🍺</span></p><p><strong><span>｜其它的秘密基地｜</span></strong></p><p><span>🏝️微信公众号：</span><strong><em><span>燕子的小岛</span></em></strong></p><p><span>🌟好物推荐公众号：</span><strong><em><span>燕子的闪光好物</span></em></strong></p><p><span>🧣微博：</span><strong><em><span>@燕子photo</span></em></strong></p><p><span>🍠小红书：</span><strong><em><span>@燕子photo</span></em></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtunRjNN1qWhQwFLjdZkc-WhGbp6.jpg"><p><span>  </span></p>]]></description>
